        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "1.2 mm heat-treated (annealed) tie wire, GOST 3282-74 (coil). Prices are from Krasnodar and Rostov-on-Don; I couldn't find wholesale prices in Sochi."
          }
